# Finance & schema

## Formulas (`finance.ts`)

```
totalInflow = sum(inflows)
totalOutflow = sum(outflows)
discretionarySurplus = totalInflow − totalOutflow − sum(allocations)
personalAllowancePerPartner = discretionarySurplus / 2
```

Always build months with `buildMonthlyRecord` / `computeMonthly`. Use `round2` for money.

- Net worth = sum of portfolio snapshot balances
- Savings rate = (inflow − outflow) / inflow; allocations count as saved
- Month keys: `YYYY-MM`

## Schema changes

1. Update `types/tandem.ts`
2. Extend `migrateState` / `normalizeV1`
3. Fail closed on unknown `version`

## Demo data

Synthetic only (`2026-09`, `2026-10`). Never replace with real household numbers in repo.
